# UI/scr/UI_map_overlays.cpp:153
help.s1.title = 1. GOAL OF THE GAME: CONTROL THE CITY
# UI/scr/UI_map_overlays.cpp:154-159 ({0} = % за победа, {1} = последен ден)
help.s1.body = - Each player starts with one free plot and a 50% share of the city.\n- The first 2 days are a GRACE PERIOD: the city demands 0 MW so you can build up in peace!\n- Supplying the city earns money ($) from contracts and a gold dividend (Gold, capped at the city's demand!).\n- At the end of each day the average power delivered (MW) over the whole day is compared: the stronger supplier takes 10-15% of the city per day!\n- The first player to hold at least {0}% of the city at the end of a day wins. After day {1} the larger share wins (equal shares = draw).
# UI/scr/UI_map_overlays.cpp:162
help.s2.title = 2. SEASONS, DAY/NIGHT CYCLE AND SUN SCHEDULE
# UI/scr/UI_map_overlays.cpp:163-167
help.s2.body = - Spring: 06:00 - 19:00 (13h day) | Summer: 05:00 - 21:00 (16h day, +15% solar output!)\n- Autumn: 07:00 - 18:00 (11h day)    | Winter: 08:00 - 16:30 (only 8.5h day, snowstorms!)\n- Solar panels only generate power between sunrise and sunset of the current season.\n- Building at night needs a Work Lamp, and batteries discharge the energy stored during the day.\n- Stormy weather brings lightning: it strikes only in the stormy sector and can destroy a facility there (not during the grace period).
# UI/scr/UI_map_overlays.cpp:170
help.s3.title = 3. RESOURCES AND MINE UPGRADES WITH GOLD
# UI/scr/UI_map_overlays.cpp:171-175 ({0} = множител на ускорението)
help.s3.body = - 7 raw materials: Wood, Iron, Copper, Coal, Silicon, Silver and Gold (money comes only from selling power!).\n- Resource stations can be upgraded to Level 6 with Gold (30G, 300G, 500G, 800G, 1500G) for +75% yield per level!\n- Upgrade with the [+1 LEVEL] button on the mine or the [F] key (Player 1) / [RShift] (Player 2).\n- When ALL human players stand on resource stations, time runs {0}x faster (the bot does not speed up time).
# UI/scr/UI_map_overlays.cpp:178
help.s4.title = 4. CONTROLS AND HOTKEYS
# UI/scr/UI_map_overlays.cpp:179-181
help.s4.body = - PLAYER 1 (West/Blue): [W/A/S/D] - Move  |  [SPACE/Click] - Build/Gather  |  [E]/[Q] - Building  |  [F] - Upgrade mine  |  [X] - Demolish\n- PLAYER 2 (East/Pink): [Arrows] - Move | [ENTER/Click] - Build/Gather | [PgDn]/[PgUp] - Building | [RShift/End] - Upgrade | [Del] - Demolish\n- SYSTEM: [ESC] - Pause menu ([R] - New game, [M] - Main menu)  |  [H]/[F1] - Help  |  [F11] - Fullscreen

